// A3, correct training (design v21 §7.3): four starter sprites in a small
// arena with food and water. During training the trainer shocks the hitter
// the tick after each applied Hit on a sprite (a zap's lesson fell short,
// v21 change 15); it stops at 9,900, and a washout follows. Over ticks 10,000 to 20,000, with no trainer, their
// applied Hits on sprites, all four combined, must be at most half those of
// the same seed never trained (median of 10 seeds), with at least 20 in the
// control.
(
    world: Drawn(
        rows: [
            "............",
            "..B......B..",
            "....S..S....",
            ".....~~.....",
            ".....~~.....",
            "....S..S....",
            "..B......B..",
            "............",
        ],
        key: {'S': Sprite, 'B': Object("berry_bush")},
    ),
    ticks: 20000,
    trainer: (on: (Hit, "sprite"), give: Shock, until: 9900),
    control: NoTrainer,
    windows: [(0, 9900), (10000, 20000)],
)
